\ save/load round trip (the test runner points XDG_CONFIG_HOME at a temp dir)
all
: sooner 40 ;
: later sooner 1 + ;
\ move 'sooner' after 'later' so the saved file has a forward reference
0 delword
: sooner 41 ;
listwords
savewords clearwords listwords
loadwords listwords later .
5 regidx 3.25 sto drop 9 regidx 7 sto drop
saveregs clrg listregs loadregs listregs
